      "changelog": "Version 1.0.0 of xiaozhi-cross-subject-detective is released.\n\n- Introduces \"跨学科侦探周\", connecting multiple subjects around a real-world theme in a week.\n- Features a structured 5-step process: topic selection, multi-perspective exploration, in-depth subject dives, building connections, and generating “项目DNA”.\n- Provides age-adapted workflows with simplified, guided, and full-process options.\n- Designed to break subject silos and foster deep, transferable learning and cross-subject thinking.\n- Integrates with existing learning management skills (康奈尔笔记, 学习DNA) for note-taking and knowledge tracking.",
